id: scrap
name: Scrap
kind: gear
# "Scrap is an Adventure Resource" - and "Adventure Resources count as Basic Items". Given by the ARC or
# gathered, never crafted: no Craft DC.
special: true
# How many, as its charges: asked when it is given, and changed on its sheet - as Ingredients are.
chargesLabel: Scrap
chargesAsked: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Adventure Resource: the pieces and materials anything is made from - spent to create Vehicles,
  Battle Jackets and [Tech] Basic Items.
text: >
  Scrap: To understand Crafting, you must first understand Scrap. Scrap is an Adventure Resource that
  represents the various pieces and materials required to make anything.

  Scrap is used to make Vehicles, Battle Jackets, and Basic Items with the [Tech] tag, but may also be
  required for various other Craft-related Adventure Maneuvers.

---

# A Basic Item on the Gear tab, its count the charges on its row: asked when it is added, changed on its
# sheet - the Ingredients' pattern (the user's ruling for Adventure Resources). Spent by the Create
# Maneuver, once it is here.
